Modifications made in this project include, without limitation:
  * replacement of the Tauri desktop shell with a Node.js/Express server
  * multi-user accounts, email/password sign-in, and TOTP second factors
  * server-side per-user library storage (playlists and liked songs)
  * a light-first interface theme
  * removal of the save-to-disk download feature
  * Docker packaging and API documentation

